# Editorial annotations only; OWL axioms and SHACL constraints above are unchanged.
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Aspect for filesystem attributes: name, size, timestamps, directory flag (permissions/owner to follow). Shared by archives and disk images."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#IntegerValueShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for Integer value. Its constraints below specify the permitted values and combinations."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#IntegerValueShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: No automatic target; applied only when another shape references it or a caller explicitly selects it. Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#RangeDatatypeShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for afs:creationTime, afs:fileName, afs:fileSize, afs:isDirectory, afs:modificationTime. afs:creationTime takes an xsd:dateTime literal (rdfs:range xsd:dateTime). afs:fileName takes an xsd:string literal (rdfs:range xsd:string). afs:fileSize takes an integer within the xsd:unsignedLong value space (rdfs:range xsd:unsignedLong). afs:isDirectory takes an xsd:boolean literal (rdfs:range xsd:boolean). afs:modificationTime takes an xsd:dateTime literal (rdfs:range xsd:dateTime)."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#RangeDatatypeShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: subjects using afs:creationTime, afs:fileName, afs:fileSize, afs:isDirectory, afs:modificationTime Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#creationTime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The source-reported time at which an entry was created; precision and timezone availability depend on the format."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#creationTime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#fileName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The name of a file or directory entry as recorded by its container or filesystem representation."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#fileName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#fileSize> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Logical (uncompressed) size in bytes."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#fileSize> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#isDirectory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Whether an entry denotes a directory rather than a regular file payload."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#isDirectory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#modificationTime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The source-reported time at which an entry's content was last modified."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta#modificationTime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
